---
/* Ambient scribe — a clinician-side surface, not a phone.

   The phone belongs to the patient. Intake is the only patient-facing step in
   this section; the scribe runs in the room while the clinician works, so it is
   drawn as a desk surface with a live transcript feeding a drafting note.

   What is worth showing is not "AI writes your note" — that is table stakes. It
   is that each drafted line stays ATTACHED to the utterance that produced it,
   so the clinician can check the source instead of trusting a summary. The two
   planes are wired together visually: the spoken line on the left carries the
   same accent as the sentence it produced on the right.

   Neumorphic rules per materials.css: light from directly above so every offset
   is Y-only, warm taupe shade, contrast in the 4-18% band, blur 2-3x the
   offset, real hairline on every surface. */
---

<div class="scb">
  <div class="scb__head">
    <span class="scb__live" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
    <span class="scb__title">Listening in the room</span>
    <span class="scb__time">04:18</span>
  </div>

  <div class="scb__panes">
    <div class="scb__said">
      <p class="scb__label">What was said</p>
      <p class="scb__line"><b>Clinician</b>Does anything make it worse?</p>
      <p class="scb__line scb__line--src"><b>Patient</b>It gets worse when I lie down flat.</p>
      <p class="scb__line"><b>Clinician</b>Any fever or fainting?</p>
      <p class="scb__line"><b>Patient</b>No, neither.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="scb__note">
      <div class="scb__note-head">
        <span>Visit note</span>
        <span class="scb__state">Drafting</span>
      </div>
      <p class="scb__body">
        Substernal chest tightness with exertional dyspnoea,
        <span class="scb__cited">worse when lying flat</span>. No fever, no
        syncope.
      </p>
      <p class="scb__attr">Every line traces back to the moment it came from.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="scb__tray">
    <span class="scb__forms"><b>24</b> letters and forms filled from the chart</span>
    <span class="scb__sign">Sign &amp; send</span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .scb {
    inline-size: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.4cqw;
    padding: 5.5cqw;
    border-radius: var(--radius-6x);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--neutral-5) 0%, var(--neutral-10) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.28);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgb(from var(--white) r g b / 0.9),
      0 1px 2px rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.14),
      0 10px 24px rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.16);
    color: var(--neutral-100);
  }

  .scb__head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2.6cqw; }
  /* A captured level readout with fixed bar heights. It does not animate. */
  .scb__live { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.9cqw; block-size: 5cqw; flex: none; }
  .scb__live i {
    inline-size: 0.9cqw; border-radius: 0.45cqw;
    background-color: var(--solace-60);
  }
  .scb__live i:nth-child(1) { block-size: 36% } .scb__live i:nth-child(2) { block-size: 72% }
  .scb__live i:nth-child(3) { block-size: 96% } .scb__live i:nth-child(4) { block-size: 54% }
  .scb__live i:nth-child(5) { block-size: 84% } .scb__live i:nth-child(6) { block-size: 42% }
  .scb__live i:nth-child(7) { block-size: 68% } .scb__live i:nth-child(8) { block-size: 30% }
  .scb__title { font-size: 3.4cqw; font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .scb__time { margin-inline-start: auto; font-size: 3.1cqw; color: var(--neutral-60); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .scb__panes { display: grid; gap: 3cqw; }
  @container (min-width: 420px) { .scb__panes { grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1fr; align-items: start; } }

  /* Pressed in: the transcript is incoming, not authored. */
  .scb__said {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2cqw;
    padding: 3.6cqw 3.8cqw;
    border-radius: var(--radius-3x);
    background-color: var(--neutral-10);
    border: 1px solid rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.18);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 2px 4px rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.20),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgb(from var(--white) r g b / 0.7);
  }
  .scb__label { font-size: 3cqw; color: var(--neutral-80); }
  .scb__line { font-size: 3.1cqw; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--neutral-90); }
  .scb__line b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.8cqw;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--neutral-80);
  }
  /* Shares the accent with the sentence it produced, which is the whole link. */
  .scb__line--src {
    margin-inline: -1.6cqw;
    padding: 1.6cqw;
    border-radius: var(--radius-2x);
    border-inline-start: 0.8cqw solid var(--solace-40);
    background-color: var(--white);
    color: var(--neutral-100);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.10);
  }

  /* Raised: the note is the artefact being made. */
  .scb__note {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.6cqw;
    padding: 4cqw 4.2cqw;
    border-radius: var(--radius-3x);
    background-color: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.20);
    box-shadow:
      0 1px 2px rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.10),
      0 8px 20px rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.14);
  }
  .scb__note-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2.4cqw; font-size: 3.3cqw; font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .scb__state {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    padding: 0.9cqw 2.4cqw;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background-color: var(--solace-10);
    color: var(--solace-80);
    font-size: 2.7cqw;
  }
  .scb__body { font-size: 3.3cqw; line-height: 1.58; color: var(--neutral-90); }
  .scb__cited {
    background-color: var(--solace-10);
    border-block-end: 0.5cqw solid var(--solace-40);
    border-radius: 0.8cqw 0.8cqw 0 0;
    padding: 0 0.6cqw;
  }
  .scb__attr { font-size: 3cqw; color: var(--neutral-80); }

  .scb__tray {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3cqw;
    padding-block-start: 3.2cqw;
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgb(from var(--neutral-40) r g b / 0.22);
    font-size: 3.1cqw;
    color: var(--neutral-60);
  }
  .scb__forms b { color: var(--solace-80); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); font-size: 4cqw; }
  .scb__sign {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    padding: 2.2cqw 3.6cqw;
    border-radius: var(--radius-2x);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--solace-60) 0%, var(--solace-80) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--solace-90);
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: 3cqw;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    white-space: nowrap;
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgb(from var(--white) r g b / 0.28),
      0 2px 5px rgb(from var(--solace-100) r g b / 0.24);
  }
</style>
